Patterns of compounding engineering

The Markdown renderer and parts of the build validation are adapted from
Engineering that compounds, https://github.com/grove/engineering-that-compounds,
and Software that improves with age,
https://github.com/grove/software-that-improves-with-age,
published by grove under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This collection adds a practical pattern catalogue, a Nordic Crisp theme,
problem-based navigation, runnable billing examples and publication checks.

